State Diagram</h3>
<p>You can specify the direction of the state diagram using one of the foll=
owing values:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>'TB'</code>: Top to bottom, the diagram flows vertically from top=
 to bottom.</li>
<li><code>'LR'</code>: Left to right, the diagram flows horizontally from l=
eft to right.</li>
<li><code>'RL'</code>: Right to left, the diagram flows horizontally from r=
ight to left.</li>
<li><code>'BT'</code>: Bottom to top, the diagram flows vertically from bot=
tom to top.</li>
</ul>
